xprof-rs

This project is a new implementation of two parts of other projects:
- the trace-viewer conversion pipeline of OpenXLA XProf (https://github.com/openxla/xprof)
- the profiler utilities of OpenXLA XLA/TSL (https://github.com/openxla/xla)

The TensorFlow Authors hold the copyright of both projects. Both projects use the Apache License 2.0.

The web interface that xprof-rs serves is the interface of XProf. The files in ui/ are the files of the XProf 2.23.2
Python package, with no changes (Apache License 2.0, copyright The TensorFlow Authors). The build compresses these files,
and the binary includes them. This project replaces only the backend. ui/materialicons.woff2 is the Material Icons font of
Google (Apache License 2.0). The JavaScript bundles include third-party libraries with their licenses, as in the XProf package.
